/*--------------------------------*- Choupo -*--------------------------------*\
  species/HLac.dat -- ONE model species, ONE typed file.

  The NEUTRAL, undissociated aqueous lactic acid (2-hydroxypropanoic acid): the speciation
  MASTER of the lactate family, from which Lac- is formed by chemistry/Lac-formation.dat
  (the tartrate pattern, species/H2Tart.dat).  No `aqueousThermo` here, as for H2Tart.
  Key names HLac / Lac cannot be confused with the acetate key HAc.
\*-----------------------------------------------------------------------------*/
recordType modelSpecies;
schemaVersion 1;

name    HLac;
formula     "HC3H5O3";
charge  0;
MW { value 90.078; unit g/mol;}
